<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“O Shuyo,” call the Japanese,</l><l>“O Tju Ah,” echo the Chinese,</l><l>“O Hallelujah,” they all exclaim.</l><l>In each land they are praising His Name.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Children are meeting in Brazil,</l><l>Canada, Mexico, Taiwan,</l><l>England, New Zealand, and Germany.</l><l>Hear them all, as they sing joyfully.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
